        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana RNE, Modern Stainless Steel 4 Inch House Letters</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4 Inch Modern Stainless Steel Address Letters are available in Letters A - D as well as in the directional letters N, S, E , and W. The Modern Stainless Steel 4 Inch House Letters can be flush mounted or can be mounted with a 11/16 inch projection using the included stand-offs. The 4 Inch Modern Address Letters come packaged with surface mount hardware. Choose from brushed stainless steel or matte black finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/4-inch-modern-stainless-steel-house-numbers-deltana-rne\"><b>Address Numbers</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Deltana Modern Font Address Letters:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .275\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware for surface mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Can be mounted flush or floating.</li>\r\n<li>There are variances in height for specific digits. Please <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-RNE-L-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262418\" target=\"new\"><b>CLICK HERE to see the specifications of each letter (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-RNE-L-finishes.jpg?v=1704354655\" width=\"394\" height=\"190\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana RNE Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
